  "productionRules": [
    "Warpaint is not a skin-pattern shader; Waves (warpaint) and Waves (Gator skin) are separate cosmetic entries.",
    "A mask tint is not an armor tint, even if both are named Nova or Requiem.",
    "Original V133 mask concepts are not replicas of original PHG mask geometry.",
    "Pirate's official Warpaint/Scar restriction does not automatically forbid original clan decorative decals, which are a separate game system.",
